# Airtable Personal Access Token, scoped to base appVftexD3KJRcdij (Canon Spine).
# Read-only scope is sufficient for sfx-canon-mcp.js. The three write-scoped
# servers need write access to their one respective table only, if your PAT
# supports per-table scoping.
AIRTABLE_API_KEY=

# Optional: override where the T0-GO marker file lives. Defaults to
# .claude/t0-go.json relative to the process working directory.
# T0_GO_MARKER_PATH=.claude/t0-go.json
